{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39991","headline":"寄天台陈希畋 · 徐夤","name":"寄天台陈希畋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴山冰冻尝迎夏，蛰户云雷只待春。\n吕望岂嫌垂钓老，西施不恨浣纱贫。\n坐爲羽猎车中相，飞作君王掌上身。\n拍手相思惟大笑，我曹宁比等闲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}